<main id="main">
<section class="phero"><img class="phero-bg" src="/assets/img/photos/consultation-table.webp" srcset="/assets/img/photos/consultation-table-640.webp 640w, /assets/img/photos/consultation-table.webp 960w" sizes="100vw" width="960" height="640" alt="" fetchpriority="high" decoding="async"><div class="wrap phero-in"><nav class="crumbs" aria-label="Breadcrumb"><a href="/">Home</a><span aria-hidden="true">›</span><a href="/policyholder-tools/">Free tools</a><span aria-hidden="true">›</span>Appraisal Readiness Checkup</nav><p class="tag">Free checklist</p><h1>Appraisal Readiness Checkup: Is Your Claim File Ready?</h1><p class="lede">Answer twelve questions to see how ready your claim is for appraisal and get a to-do list for anything missing.</p></div></section>
<section class="sec tool-sec"><div class="wrap">
<div class="tool tool-wide" data-tool="ready">
  <div class="tool-head"><span>Appraisal readiness checkup</span><i>12 questions · about two minutes</i></div>
  <div class="tool-body">
    <div class="tool-in">
      <ol class="quiz"><li data-w="3" data-fix="Get written confirmation that coverage is accepted. If the claim was denied, talk to a Rhode Island attorney before thinking about appraisal."><span>Has the insurer accepted coverage for at least part of the loss?</span><span class="yn"><button type="button" class="yes" aria-pressed="false">Yes</button><button type="button" class="no" aria-pressed="false">No</button></span></li><li data-w="3" data-fix="Ask in writing for the full line-item estimate, not just the summary page."><span>Do you have the carrier’s complete, itemized estimate?</span><span class="yn"><button type="button" class="yes" aria-pressed="false">Yes</button><button type="button" class="no" aria-pressed="false">No</button></span></li><li data-w="3" data-fix="Get an independent line-item estimate. A one-line contractor bid won’t hold up in front of a panel."><span>Do you have your own itemized estimate?</span><span class="yn"><button type="button" class="yes" aria-pressed="false">Yes</button><button type="button" class="no" aria-pressed="false">No</button></span></li><li data-w="2" data-fix="Collect every photo and note when each was taken. Add photos of current conditions."><span>Do you have dated photos taken soon after the loss?</span><span class="yn"><button type="button" class="yes" aria-pressed="false">Yes</button><button type="button" class="no" aria-pressed="false">No</button></span></li><li data-w="2" data-fix="Find ‘Appraisal’ in the policy conditions and note any timelines."><span>Have you read the appraisal paragraph in your policy?</span><span class="yn"><button type="button" class="yes" aria-pressed="false">Yes</button><button type="button" class="no" aria-pressed="false">No</button></span></li><li data-w="2" data-fix="Check the declarations page and the hurricane deductible endorsement, then run our hurricane deductible calculator."><span>Do you know which deductible applies (standard or hurricane)?</span><span class="yn"><button type="button" class="yes" aria-pressed="false">Yes</button><button type="button" class="no" aria-pressed="false">No</button></span></li><li data-w="2" data-fix="Make reasonable temporary repairs, such as tarping or water extraction, and keep every receipt."><span>Have temporary repairs been made and receipts kept?</span><span class="yn"><button type="button" class="yes" aria-pressed="false">Yes</button><button type="button" class="no" aria-pressed="false">No</button></span></li><li data-w="2" data-fix="Make sure wet walls, attics, insulation and roof decking have been checked so the scope is complete."><span>Has hidden damage been opened up and documented?</span><span class="yn"><button type="button" class="yes" aria-pressed="false">Yes</button><button type="button" class="no" aria-pressed="false">No</button></span></li><li data-w="2" data-fix="Mark flood water lines and list wind and rain damage separately. Our wind vs. flood splitter can help."><span>If the storm brought water, have you separated wind damage from flood damage?</span><span class="yn"><button type="button" class="yes" aria-pressed="false">Yes</button><button type="button" class="no" aria-pressed="false">No</button></span></li><li data-w="1" data-fix="Gather emails, letters and claim notes in one dated file."><span>Is your correspondence with the carrier in date order?</span><span class="yn"><button type="button" class="yes" aria-pressed="false">Yes</button><button type="button" class="no" aria-pressed="false">No</button></span></li><li data-w="2" data-fix="Run the settlement gap estimator. A small gap may not justify appraisal costs."><span>Is the gap more than about 10% of the carrier’s estimate, or several thousand dollars?</span><span class="yn"><button type="button" class="yes" aria-pressed="false">Yes</button><button type="button" class="no" aria-pressed="false">No</button></span></li><li data-w="1" data-fix="Find the ‘Suit Against Us’ condition and put the date on your calendar."><span>Do you know your policy’s suit-limitation date?</span><span class="yn"><button type="button" class="yes" aria-pressed="false">Yes</button><button type="button" class="no" aria-pressed="false">No</button></span></li>
      </ol>
      <div class="btn-row"><button type="button" class="btn line small" data-reset>Reset answers</button></div>
    </div>
    <div class="tool-out ready-out" aria-live="polite">
      <div class="gauge"><svg viewBox="0 0 100 100" width="160" height="160" aria-hidden="true"><circle cx="50" cy="50" r="40" fill="none" stroke="var(--line)" stroke-width="10"/><circle data-o="arc" cx="50" cy="50" r="40" fill="none" stroke="var(--sun)" stroke-width="10" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-dasharray="251.3" stroke-dashoffset="251.3" transform="rotate(-90 50 50)"/></svg><div class="gauge-n"><b data-o="score">–</b><small>score</small></div></div>
      <div><p class="out-msg" data-o="verdict"></p><p class="hint">Answered: <span data-o="count">0 / 12</span></p><p class="todo-t">To do before appraisal</p><ul class="todo" data-o="todo"></ul></div>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>
<p class="hint center">For planning only. Results depend on the figures you enter and your policy’s terms. They aren’t a quote, an appraisal or legal advice.</p></div></section>
<div class="wrap layout"><article class="prose">
<h2>Why readiness matters</h2>
<p>An appraisal award is binding on the amount of loss once two members of the panel sign. If your documentation is thin when appraisal starts, the result can be lower than it should be, and it’s hard to undo. The checkup weights the items that matter most: accepted coverage, both itemized estimates and photos.</p>
<h2>How the score works</h2>
<p>Each question has a weight from one to three. Your score is the share of weighted points answered “yes.” A “no” adds an item to your to-do list.</p><h2>Questions about this tool</h2><div class="faq"><details><summary>What score should I aim for?<svg class="ic chev" width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><path d="M6 9l6 6 6-6"/></svg></summary><div class="faq-a"><p>Above about 75 means the essentials are in place. Below that, work through the to-do list first.</p></div></details><details><summary>Can I invoke appraisal with a low score?<svg class="ic chev" width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><path d="M6 9l6 6 6-6"/></svg></summary><div class="faq-a"><p>You can, but it’s risky. Gaps in documentation tend to work against the party with the burden of showing the damage.</p></div></details><details><summary>Is my information stored?<svg class="ic chev" width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><path d="M6 9l6 6 6-6"/></svg></summary><div class="faq-a"><p>No. Answers stay in your browser.</p></div></details></div><h2>More free tools</h2><div class="related"><a href="/policyholder-tools/wind-flood-damage-splitter/"><small>Tool</small><span>Wind vs. Flood Damage Splitter</span><svg class="ic" width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><path d="M5 12h14M13 6l6 6-6 6"/></svg></a><a href="/policyholder-tools/settlement-gap-estimator/"><small>Tool</small><span>Settlement Gap Estimator</span><svg class="ic" width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><path d="M5 12h14M13 6l6 6-6 6"/></svg></a><a href="/policyholder-tools/rcv-acv-holdback-calculator/"><small>Tool</small><span>RCV / ACV Holdback Calculator</span><svg class="ic" width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><path d="M5 12h14M13 6l6 6-6 6"/></svg></a></div></article><aside class="side"><div class="box box-call"><h2 class="box-t">Talk it through</h2><p>A free first conversation. We’ll tell you plainly whether appraisal fits your claim.</p><a class="box-phone" href="tel:+18445371427">+1 (844) 537-1427</a><a class="btn ink" href="/request-a-claim-review/">Send claim details</a></div><div class="box"><h2 class="box-t">All claim tools</h2><ul class="box-list"><li><a href="/policyholder-tools/settlement-gap-estimator/">Settlement Gap Estimator<svg class="ic" width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><path d="M9 18l6-6-6-6"/></svg></a></li><li><a href="/policyholder-tools/rcv-acv-holdback-calculator/">RCV / ACV Holdback Calculator<svg class="ic" width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><path d="M9 18l6-6-6-6"/></svg></a></li><li><a href="/policyholder-tools/roof-area-pitch-converter/">Roof Area &amp; Pitch Converter<svg class="ic" width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><path d="M9 18l6-6-6-6"/></svg></a></li><li><a href="/policyholder-tools/hurricane-deductible-calculator/">Hurricane Deductible Calculator<svg class="ic" width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><path d="M9 18l6-6-6-6"/></svg></a></li><li><a href="/policyholder-tools/claim-timeline-builder/">Claim Timeline Builder<svg class="ic" width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><path d="M9 18l6-6-6-6"/></svg></a></li><li><a href="/policyholder-tools/appraisal-readiness-checkup/" aria-current="page">Appraisal Readiness Checkup<svg class="ic" width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><path d="M9 18l6-6-6-6"/></svg></a></li><li><a href="/policyholder-tools/wind-flood-damage-splitter/">Wind vs. Flood Damage Splitter<svg class="ic" width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><path d="M9 18l6-6-6-6"/></svg></a></li></ul></div></aside></div><section class="strip"><div class="wrap strip-in rv"><div><h2>Want a professional to check the numbers?</h2><p>Send us your estimate and we’ll review it line by line.</p></div><div class="btn-row"><a class="btn ink" href="tel:+18445371427"><svg class="ic" width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><path d="M22 16.9v3a2 2 0 0 1-2.2 2 19.8 19.8 0 0 1-8.6-3.1 19.5 19.5 0 0 1-6-6A19.8 19.8 0 0 1 2.1 4.2 2 2 0 0 1 4.1 2h3a2 2 0 0 1 2 1.7c.1.9.4 1.8.7 2.7a2 2 0 0 1-.5 2.1L8 9.8a16 16 0 0 0 6 6l1.3-1.3a2 2 0 0 1 2.1-.4c.9.3 1.8.6 2.7.7a2 2 0 0 1 1.7 2z"/></svg> (844) 537-1427</a><a class="bt